is pour révisions longues.","Acceptez-vous les véhicules de société ?","Oui, facturation avec TVA et bon de commande, créneaux matin pour limiter l’immobilisation.",{"_88":96,"_90":97,"_92":98},{"_88":94,"_90":26,"_92":95},{"_88":89,"_90":91,"_92":93},"name","Henri K.","city","Illkirch","text","CT passé du premier coup après leur préparation. Tarifs corrects pour le pneu.","Aurélie T.","Garage de quartier sérieux : ils m’expliquent ce qui est urgent ou peut attendre.","Luc M.","Schiltigheim","Devis clair pour la distribution, voiture rendue le jour promis. Pas de mauvaise surprise.",{"_57":157,"_106":158,"_108":26,"_109":159,"_111":160,"_113":161,"_162":163,"_164":165},{"_57":148,"_106":149,"_108":26,"_109":150,"_111":151,"_113":152},{"_57":139,"_106":140,"_108":26,"_109":141,"_111":142,"_113":143},{"_57":130,"_106":131,"_108":26,"_109":132,"_111":133,"_113":134},{"_57":121,"_106":122,"_108":26,"_109":123,"_111":124,"_113":125},{"_57":105,"_106":107,"_108":26,"_109":110,"_111":112,"_113":114},"p6","title","Embrayage utilitaire","location","summary","Kit embrayage et volant moteur bi-masse sur fourgon.","image",{"_118":119,"_120":107},"tags",[115,116,117],"embrayage","utilitaire","réparation","src","/sites-artisans/img/garage/p6.jpg","alt","p5","Préparation contrôle technique","Corrections niveaux, éclairage, freinage et pollution avant passage.",{"_118":129,"_120":122},[126,127,128],"contrôle technique","préparation","diagnostic","/sites-artisans/img/garage/p5.jpg","p4","Climatisation rechargée","Test étanchéité circuit, recharge gaz R1234yf conforme.",{"_118":138,"_120":131},[135,136,137],"climatisation","confort","recharge","/sites-artisans/img/garage/p4.jpg","p3","Distribution diesel","Courroie, galets et pompe à eau, vidange liquide refroidissement.",{"_118":147,"_120":140},[144,145,146],"distribution","moteur","courroie","/sites-artisans/img/garage/p3.jpg","p2","Freins avant SUV","Disques ventilés et plaquettes céramique, essai route.",{"_118":156,"_120":149},[